sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Router as userRoutes.js
    participant DB as MongoDB User

    Client->>Router: POST /api/users/register username, email, password
    Router->>DB: User.findOne(email)
    DB-->>Router: existing user or null

    alt Email already registered
        Router-->>Client: 400 User already exists
    else Email available
        Router->>DB: User.create(username, email, password)
        Note right of DB: pre save hook runs, bcrypt.hash(password, 10)
        DB-->>Router: created user document
        Router-->>Client: 201 id, username, email
    end

    Note over Router,Client: On thrown error, catch returns 400 with error.message
